  },
  {
   "sid": "s3",
   "date": "2026-06-30",
   "url": "https://www.mlex.com/mlex/articles/2495346/us-regulator-of-foreign-investment-eyes-agentic-ai-data-centers",
   "text": "It's really about, ‘What's the potential weaponization of that,' and what the dual use could be",
   "source_type": "reported_statement",
