  {
   "sid": "s5",
   "date": "2025-09-08",
   "url": "https://www.banking.senate.gov/imo/media/doc/pilkerton_response.pdf",
   "text": "If confirmed, I will carefully consider national security risks related to advances in technology and ensure that CFIUS and the Outbound Investment Security Program are responsive.",
